# Rip, Spawn Hunter: X is its power as the ability resolves (CR 608.2h), and a power of 0 or less reveals no card (CR 107.1b). On
# turn 3 Bot1 casts Depower on Rip for {2}{U} (Mox Sapphire, Mox Emerald, Mox Ruby): it is a 0/4, draws Bot1 the Forest, and
# attacks for no damage. At the second main phase the survival trigger reveals nothing: Bot1 is asked nothing, and the Grizzly
# Bears stay on top of the library where a reveal of even one card would have offered them and moved what was left to the bottom.

